+    /**
+     * Phase one of draining the native observation buffer (real device fixes
+     * recorded independently of the JS bridge, see GpsBufferJournal): stage
+     * whatever is journaled and hand back the batch plus health timestamps.
+     * Nothing is deleted yet — a caller that dies before acking (app killed
